  sb      the second group's first shell (or the ket shell)
  ngb     the shells in the second group
  sph     `1` for spherical functions, `0` for Cartesian
  T       the pair transform `(M_a (x) M_b)^T`
  la      the first shell's angular momentum
  lb      the second shell's angular momentum
  na      the first shell's Cartesian components
  nb      the second shell's Cartesian components
  nra     the first shell's rows: spherical or Cartesian components
  nrb     the second shell's rows
  npa     the first shell's primitives
  npb     the second shell's primitives
  npp     primitive pairs, `npa npb`
  nh      the Hermite functions of order up to `la + lb`
  nr      rows per shell pair
  A       the first shell's atom's position
  B       one quartet's block, `[rows of k1, rows of k2]`
  E       the pair's E matrix, `[rows, npp nh]`
  a       the first primitive's exponent
  b       the second primitive's exponent
  k       a store pair
  p       the bra product exponent `a + b`
  Vf      the flat expansion `mdg_pair` writes
  EX      the E table on x
  EY      the E table on y
  EZ      the E table on z
  V       one primitive pair's expansion, Cartesian rows (flat, then as a matrix)
