  h       half of the pairs, for the split
  i       the row's first function
  j       the row's second function

  = ST    the pack header, md_eri's five numbers
  = mdg_pair()  one primitive pair's Cartesian expansion; `T @ V` moves it to spherical rows
  = E     the expansion times each shell pair's contraction coefficients
  = ST#7  the row index: packed index and the two functions of each row

